translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_ab7c30eb:

    # "A poster of the progress of mossy rocks coming to life after pouring the flowing water from a special basin."
    "一张展示苔藓岩石在浇灌特殊盆中流出的水后逐渐获得生命过程的海报。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_bfc5352d:

    # "It seems to be what created the moss guardians in the past. But the graph explicitly says that a long growth cycle is needed to raise a guardians, which includes an extensive amount of flowing water."
    "看起来，过去就是这样创造出苔藓守卫者的。不过图表明确写着，要培育出一个守卫者，需要经历漫长的生长周期，还要用上大量流动的水。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_2ab7ac54:

    # e "Gwyd, is what the poster behind you true?"
    e "格威德，你身后的海报上说的是真的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_d6467519:

    # g "Ah yes, so this is why you were staring at me for so long, wanderer."
    g "啊，原来如此。漫游者，难怪你一直盯着我看。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_eede159f:

    # g "You can say, the guardians comes from water dripped from some stones, onto some stones, and moss grows on the stones, which gives life to these, stones."
    g "你可以这么理解：水从一些石头上滴落到另一些石头上，苔藓在石头上生长，赋予这些石头生命，于是便形成了守卫者。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_efe94710:

    # g "And these stones, guarded the magical stone which gives it sustenance in return, until said stone was stolen, and the guardians just went for the closest source of the flowing water."
    g "而这些石头守护着那块魔法石；作为回报，魔法石为它们提供养分。直到那块石头被偷走，守卫者便转而寻找最近的流动水源。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_b1c473c9:

    # g "Now, imagine the general consulted me when they went searching for the chief."
    g "现在想想，他们去寻找酋长时，居然还来向我这位将军请教。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_911c6cfb:

    # e "That doesn't sound, logical?"
    e "听起来不太合乎逻辑吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_77f04980:

    # g "Nothing in a magical world is logical, wanderer, though I suppose you aren't one familiar."
    g "在魔法世界里，没有什么是合乎逻辑的，漫游者。不过我猜你并不熟悉这样的世界。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_c3c28b12:

    # g "These are one of the more fascinating creatures of Mokken, the other ones are the mimics, which are just pesky fellows pretending to hide precious gems and crystals."
    g "这些是莫肯最迷人的生物之一。另一种则是拟态怪——一群讨厌的家伙，假装藏着珍贵的宝石和水晶。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_2f8b4d12:

    # e "It sounds like you got into some troubles with the mimics."
    e "听起来，你似乎和那些拟态怪打过不少交道。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_ee3f1300:

    # g "Who doesn't. But, if you're one experienced adventurer, wanderer. You just have to slip away when it tries to strangle hold you with its tongue."
    g "谁没遇到过呢。不过，像你这样的老练冒险者、游荡者，只要在它用舌头缠住你、试图勒死你时设法脱身就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_04c4896e:

    # g "Afterall, it's just pure inconvenience when you get trapped inside."
    g "毕竟，被困在里面也不过是件麻烦事而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_1a52acb1:

    # "A magical diagram of a rather ambiguous face, with descriptions on the bottom of the poster, you wonder if it has anything to do with the runes."
    "一张画着颇为模糊面孔的魔法图示，海报底部还附有说明。你不禁猜想，这是否与符文有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_4dc680bd:

    # e "Gwyd, what's this? Can you translate it for me?"
    e "格威德，这是什么？你能帮我翻译一下吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_2de2115c:

    # g "Ah, that's just the wanted poster for the thief who stole the primordial runes."
    g "哦，那只是张通缉令，通缉的是那个偷走了原初符文的小偷。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_db0a830d:

    # g "It was such a long time ago, the chief had already gave up on the chase, but I didn't bother to take it down, let's just say the thief's still out there somewhere."
    g "那是很久以前的事了，首领早就放弃追捕，但我懒得把它取下来。就姑且当作那个小偷还在某处游荡吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_14a774a7:

    # "A crawler plant that's been growing in the shop, it's a rare sight to see one thriving on top of the shelves."
    "店里长着一株爬行植物，能看到它在货架顶上茁壮生长，实在难得。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_ardent_cauldron_3185d26d:

    # "You've seen these plants before, they're usually found in the dark forest, and they're known to grow everywhere, even in the most unlikely places."
    "你以前见过这种植物，它们通常生长在黑暗森林里，而且到处都能长，哪怕是最不可能出现的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_5e0f1bd5:

    # "You stumble inside the magical structure, it is much bigger than what you saw from outside."
    "你踉跄着走进这座魔法建筑，里面比从外面看到的要大得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_c916ff0a:

    # "And just like everywhere in the Goat Tribe, the cottage is brimming with sparkling blue light."
    "和山羊部落的其他地方一样，这间小屋里也充满了闪烁的蓝光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_d917468c:

    # "At the counter, you see a dark sheep, staring at what you think is a mana crystal."
    "柜台前，你看到一只深色的绵羊正盯着一块你认为是法力水晶的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_e57a84c0:

    # my "Welcome to the Ardent Cauldron. Blissful as the name suggests, do not get close with our cauldron, lest you fear for a self-immolation."
    my "欢迎来到炽热坩埚。正如名字所暗示的那样，这里令人愉悦；不过，要是你不想自焚，就别靠近我们的坩埚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_2fcde692:

    # "The shopkeeper does not look at you for one moment, instead he continues inspecting the crystal with his monocle. Completely unaware of your presence."
    "店主一眼都没看你，反而继续用单片眼镜检查那块水晶，完全没有察觉你的存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_f0c430f7:

    # "Ignored, you try to look around the place, the shop is filled with shelves, but most of them are already empty."
    "你被晾在一旁，只好试着环顾四周。店里摆满了货架，但大多数已经空空如也。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_0555a47e:

    # "However, it was overall kept clean and elegant. You doubt there was ever a trace of dust ever landed on the shelf."
    "不过，整个店铺都保持得干净而雅致。你甚至怀疑货架上从未落过一丝灰尘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_868c9ff5:

    # "You see the aforementioned Cauldron on the right side of the shop, fueled by blue crystals, but it doesn't seem running very well."
    "你看到店铺右侧那口前面提到的坩埚，它由蓝色水晶驱动，但运转得似乎不太好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_b88773da:

    # "For a while you stand there, checking out the blue marks on the surface of the empty shelves, up until the shopkeeper glances back at you."
    "你在那里站了一会儿，打量着空货架表面的蓝色痕迹，直到店主回头瞥了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_b906fded:

    # "He returns to look at the crystal soon after, until he raises his eyebrows again. The sheep repeats this actions for a few times before breaking the silence."
    "他很快又转回去查看水晶，随后再次挑起眉毛。那只绵羊如此重复了几次，才打破沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_478f5e08:

    # my "Why are you still here?"
    my "你怎么还在这儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_b5de5baf:

    # "The shopkeeper sounds impatient, he's not exactly rude, instead, he's the opposite of rude. But the way he speaks makes you feel like you've offended him personally."
    "店主的语气听起来有些不耐烦，但并不算无礼，甚至可以说恰恰相反。不过，他说话的方式让你觉得自己仿佛冒犯了他本人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_3f94ff28:

    # my "Wait, who are you?"
    my "等等，你是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_9ebc3800:

    # "You are as confused as he is, especially when he raises his glass to examine you from over the counter like the crystal on his hand."
    "你和他一样困惑，尤其是他从柜台后举起单片眼镜，像端详手中的水晶一样检查着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_d981cc77:

    # e "I'm [e], nice to meet you."
    e "我是[e]，很高兴认识你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_fbc23e26:

    # my "Oh?"
    my "哦？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_2e85e142:

    # my "The famous [e] from Lusterfield who saved the chieftain that other day? Needless to say, didn't expect you to look like a goat, horns jutting out like the others."
    my "你就是那个来自卢斯特菲尔德、前些天救了酋长的著名[e]？我没想到你看起来会像只山羊，和其他人一样长着向外突出的角。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_257e0c2c:

    # e "Well, dragons can have horns too."
    e "嗯，龙也可以长角啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_abe45804:

    # g "Ahem, the name's Gwyddyon. And in case you don't know, I own this place."
    g "咳，我叫格威迪恩。免得你不知道，这地方是我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_b1e5ea36:

    # g "There's only one rule here - no discussion about where you came from."
    g "这里就一条规矩——不许谈你是从哪儿来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_3d317523:

    # e "You sound like you know something..."
    e "听起来你知道些什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_ed70962a:

    # g "Second rule, no discussion about that missing friend of yours."
    g "第二条规矩，不许谈你那个失踪的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_7781a6a3:

    # e "You have seen him?"
    e "你见过他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_4b01601b:

    # "Gwyddyon raises his eyebrows again."
    "格威迪恩又挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_9804c08e:

    # g "What did I say about the rules again?"
    g "我刚才说规矩来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_68a9c0c9:

    # g "Now, any other topics you would like to discuss?"
    g "那么，还有别的话题想聊吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_cbf37e9e:

    # e "Why did you ask me why I'm still here?"
    e "你为什么要问我为什么还在这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_c0121b46:

    # g "Like I said, you looked just like any goats that wander around here."
    g "就像我说的，你看起来跟在这附近晃荡的山羊没什么两样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_817c98ba:

    # g "But then, you just stood there, staring at me for a while, and I thought you were just another idiot who got lost and wandered into my shop."
    g "可后来，你就那么站在那里盯着我看了好一会儿，我还以为你只是又一个迷路闯进我店里的蠢货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_521065f5:

    # e "Hmmm... What caused you to be this petty?"
    e "嗯……你怎么会这么小心眼？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_b922b54a:

    # g "Third rule, no disrespec-"
    g "第三条规矩，不许不尊重——"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_e3322118:

    # e "Alright, alright. I get it."
    e "好好好，我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_2da8ab68:

    # e "So what now, I just wait until you decide I'm worth talking to?"
    e "那现在呢？我就这么等着，直到你觉得我值得一谈？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_da8707bd:

    # g "More or less. If you want my rules to bend, you'll need patience."
    g "差不多吧。你要是想让我通融规矩，就得有耐心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_964a64f5:

    # g "As a wise man once said, A watched cauldron never b-"
    g "正如某位智者曾说，盯着看的坩埚永远不会沸——"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_c91da9c3:

    # e "Boils?"
    e "沸腾？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_9cb3b735:

    # "Gwyddyon squints at you with repulsion."
    "格威迪恩一脸嫌恶地眯起眼睛看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_96293236:

    # g "Who taught you that, Haskell? That old dragon done stealing my sayings."
    g "谁教你的，哈斯克尔？那条老龙净会偷我的说法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_a62a2257:

    # e "I didn't even know you two knew each other."
    e "我甚至不知道你们两个认识。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_acd5c189:

    # g "It doesn't matter. Crystals are far superior than potions, that's all you need to know."
    g "这不重要。水晶比药剂强多了，你知道这些就够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_cf82a852:

    # e "Wait, you don't sell potions here?"
    e "等等，你这里不卖药剂吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_ad1bca88:

    # g "I have potions, but I tell you, even if his potions look better than mine, crystal is still the best choice."
    g "我有药剂，不过我告诉你，就算他的药剂看起来比我的好，水晶仍然是最佳选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_0b67d9ab:

    # g "Look at this."
    g "看这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_0ffe9314:

    # "Gwyddyon holds the blue crystal over to you, it glistens directly above your eyes."
    "格威迪恩把蓝色水晶举到你面前，它正悬在你眼睛上方，闪闪发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_c3430278:

    # g "This little fella here stores such much potentials in there. Just putting it on gives you a huge boost in magical performance."
    g "这小家伙里面储存着巨大的潜能。只要把它戴上，就能让你的魔法施展能力大幅提升。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_ea8fb316:

    # g "Think for a second, if you use his potions, by the time you finish a bottle, you'd already been stabbed thousands of times."
    g "想想看，要是你用他的药水，等你喝完一瓶，恐怕早就被捅上几千刀了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_5ec3b5cf:

    # "The sheep bluffs, pulling the crystal from your view."
    "那只羊故作镇定，把水晶从你眼前移开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_fc161983:

    # e "You're right, but I suppose the mana they provide can't last in the battle... right?"
    e "你说得对，不过我想它们提供的魔力在战斗中没法持久……对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_356f4108:

    # "Gwyddyon shakes his head."
    "格威迪恩摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_a2ab2bd0:

    # g "That's where you're wrong, these things regenerate mana by themselves over time."
    g "你错就错在这里了，这些东西会随着时间推移自行恢复魔力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_c4ae9051:

    # g "I know you can see what those goats don't understand, even if the primordial runes are gone, they still have these magnificent crystals."
    g "我知道你看得出那些山羊不明白的地方：即使原初符文消失了，它们仍拥有这些瑰丽的水晶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_96f22026:

    # g "I tell you, they're as good as flowing water, albeit scarce, but that's the price you need to pay."
    g "我跟你说，它们就跟流动的水一样好用，只是数量稀少——这就是你必须付出的代价。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_7de27c68:

    # e "How much do they cost?"
    e "它们要多少钱？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_46f660a3:

    # g "Necklace made from one of them costs 1750 gold. It's not that expensive considering how much goats like magic."
    g "用其中一颗制成的项链要1750枚金币。考虑到山羊对魔法的喜爱，这并不算贵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_dd9c66a3:

    # "Needless to say, the price is not anything you've seen before. Even back at The King's Pawn, the price's only at most a few hundreds."
    "不用说，这个价格你以前从没见过。就连在君临典当，价格最多也就几百枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_cab608d6:

    # e "A-alright. Thanks for letting me know, Gwyddyon."
    e "好、好的。谢谢你告诉我，格威迪恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_a5e03c15:

    # g "You're most likely welcome. In any case, guess I'll have to see you another time."
    g "大概不用客气。总之，看来我们得改天再见了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_a3894f8c:

    # "You decide to probe Gwyddyon again."
    "你决定再次试探格威迪恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_8eaef675:

    # e "If you ever learn anything about Chime, will you let me know?"
    e "如果你以后得知任何关于齐门的消息，能告诉我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_df8654db:

    # g "Again? Who's he to you anyway?"
    g "又来？他对你来说究竟是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_130f1dd0:

    # e "He's my best friend, just back in our tribe. I suppose you already kno-"
    e "他是我最好的朋友，只是他还在我们的部落。我猜你已经知道——"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_77896d32:

    # g "No, I don't know anything about him. I've heard his name a few times, but I'm sure they were talking about bells."
    g "不，我对他一无所知。我听过他的名字几次，但我敢肯定，他们说的是钟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_63e1b0ee:

    # e "W-wait. Are you sure...? How can you be so sure?"
    e "等、等一下。你确定吗……？你怎么能这么肯定？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_f58fb1a9:

    # g "A rather easy explanation would be that you're chasing answers no one here can give, if I may."
    g "如果你不介意，一个相当简单的解释是：你正在追寻这里没人能给你的答案。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_5cb15c0d:

    # "You exhale deeply. It sounds like he's just done with your topic."
    "你深深吐出一口气。听起来，他已经不想再谈这个话题了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_eb02cb0a:

    # g "Alright that's it. Like I said, no discussion regarding your missing friend. We ought to stop here and you move on."
    g "好了，就到此为止。正如我说的，不谈你那位失踪的朋友。我们应该在这里停下，你也该继续上路了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_429efa5c:

    # "The sheep retires to lean back, looking at his crystal."
    "那只羊退开，靠坐下来，望着自己的水晶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_59de1728:

    # g "Settle in this world, wanderer. There's something in this world you'd be better off not knowing."
    g "在这个世界安顿下来吧，漫游者。有些事，你最好还是不要知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_cd9a4dcb:

    # "The word sends your body full of shivers, he definitely knows something about you. But he refuses to elaborate."
    "这句话让你浑身发抖，他显然知道一些关于你的事。但他拒绝详述。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_a9c4d621:

    # "And thinking about what happened back then, with every day gone by, you feel your memory in the home world is fading bit by bit, you're not sure how long you can cling onto these memories..."
    "回想起当时发生的一切，随着一天又一天过去，你感觉自己对故乡的记忆正一点点淡去，也不知道还能将这些记忆留在心里多久……"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_2a33b596:

    # "Regardless, you could live the rest of your life here, but these fond memories with Chime compels you to find out the truth of what exactly happened."
    "无论如何，你或许能在这里度过余生，但与齐门共度的那些美好回忆驱使着你去查明事情究竟是怎么发生的真相。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_First_Meet_14726b48:

    # "You politely nods, and let Gwyddyon return to his task."
    "你礼貌地点点头，让格威迪恩回去继续忙他的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Dialogue_6ceae024:

    # g "Welcome to The Ardent Cauldron. Take a look around, crystals, weapons, wares. All for sale at a fair prices."
    g "欢迎来到炽热坩埚。随便看看吧，水晶、武器、货物应有尽有，价格公道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Dialogue_f1901dce:

    # "Gwyddyon raises his head to take a good glance at you."
    "格威迪恩抬起头，仔细打量了你一番。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Dialogue_69b05af7:

    # g "If it's not the famous [e]."
    g "如果不是大名鼎鼎的[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Normal_Talk_afc2a572:

    # g "We have everything you'd ever need right here, Wanderer." nointeract
    g "我们这里有你这个漫游者想要的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Normal_Talk_ac0f2308:

    # e "That's all I need to know, thank you Gwyddyon."
    e "我想知道的就这些了，谢谢你，格威迪恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Normal_Talk_93d16ea9:

    # g "And until next time, Wanderer."
    g "那么，下次再见，漫游者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_c6942587:

    # e "Gwyddyon, what is the business like now?"
    e "格威迪恩，现在生意怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_e5171cd8:

    # g "It's acceptable. We no longer have a strong inventory of imports, but the goats still keeps a few crystals in their house."
    g "还过得去。我们不再有充足的进口货存货了，不过山羊族家里还留着几枚水晶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_6d2450a9:

    # g "What Furkan did, didn't help the shop as well. And I doubt it helps the tribe."
    g "弗坎的所作所为也没让店里的情况好转。我怀疑这对部落也没什么帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_565fedb6:

    # e "What do you think about trading with Lusterfield?"
    e "你觉得和卢斯特菲尔德做生意怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_aad4a25b:

    # g "Ah, that's why you're here. Advocating sales for your Lusterfolks?"
    g "啊，原来你是为此而来。想替你的卢斯特菲尔德人推销商品？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_1d725222:

    # g "Well I don't mind. As long as the wolf is permanently removed from this realm."
    g "我倒是不介意，只要那头狼永远离开这个领域。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_0db8ff06:

    # e "By removed from this realm, you mean...?"
    e "你说的离开这个领域，是指……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_ded70600:

    # g "Mostly my shop, and if I have to trade with the Lusterfolks I can't have him step foot in there too."
    g "主要是离开我的店。如果我得和卢斯特菲尔德人做生意，也不能让他踏进店里半步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_f5ac5cf3:

    # "Gwyddyon almost says this nonchalantly, if not with a sprinkle of fury."
    "格威迪恩说得几乎漫不经心，语气中却夹着一丝怒意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_906de268:

    # "But still, it was his most emotional side you've seen so far."
    "不过话说回来，这是你目前见过他情绪最激动的一面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_94742fb7:

    # e "That's another weird rule."
    e "又是一条奇怪的规矩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_3901ab39:

    # g "You can always, not strike a trade deal with me."
    g "你大可以不跟我做交易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_e20be8e3:

    # g "And it's not like your people over there are fond of magic. Most of the trade might result in a loss considering the transportation."
    g "而且你们那边的人又不喜欢魔法。考虑到运输，大部分贸易可能都会亏损。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_7115ea73:

    # e "A-alright."
    e "好、好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Business_e5af7817:

    # g "However, those two... other dimwits weren't exactly hard to deal with, I can consider the trade if they ever contact me."
    g "不过，那两个……其他那些蠢货倒也不难对付。要是他们哪天联系我，我可以考虑这笔交易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_How_Doing_4a0a90ac:

    # e "What are you doing... Gwyddyon?"
    e "你在做什么……格威迪恩？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_How_Doing_5838ec02:

    # g "Inspecting Crystals, obviously."
    g "显然是在检查水晶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_How_Doing_ba4e620d:

    # e "When are you not inspecting crystals...?"
    e "你什么时候才不检查水晶……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_How_Doing_a21901d6:

    # g "When you're gone."
    g "等你走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_How_Doing_2f64a912:

    # e "Ouch... that hurts."
    e "哎哟……真疼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_How_Doing_b69a9e0e:

    # "You says sarcastically, trying to get a reaction out of Gwyddyon."
    "你故意用讽刺的语气说道，想从格威迪恩那里引出点反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_How_Doing_fb6ed8fd:

    # g "Good."
    g "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_How_Doing_3c319680:

    # "The shopkeeper never take a gander at you, he just continues with his crystal. Leaving you alone."
    "店主压根没看你一眼，只是继续摆弄他的水晶，任你待在一边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_33f1d8a7:

    # e "So, when did you open the shop?"
    e "那你是什么时候开店的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_cf812f5f:

    # g "Oh, getting too ambitious now. Aren't we?"
    g "哦，现在胃口变大了，是吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_6f07d1f2:

    # g "Well, I can't share my precious knowledge without getting a few bucks."
    g "我总不能不收几个钱，就把我珍贵的知识告诉你吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_678dcf21:

    # "Gwyddyon stares at your bag, clearly sizing up your gold carefully."
    "格威迪恩盯着你的袋子，显然在仔细掂量你有多少金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_e775efdc:

    # g "Well, no point for you to pay through the snout."
    g "嗯，没必要让你花这笔冤枉钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_fabd603d:

    # g "Fill your pouch, and maybe we'll talk."
    g "先把你的钱袋装满，说不定我们就能谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_a1390047:

    # "The sheep points at your gold, perhaps you've got too little gold for his taste. But he"
    "绵羊指了指你的金币，或许在他看来，你的金币还不够多。不过他……"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_3f9bcf67:

    # g "Misleading as a name often is, I'm not that greedy, in fact the opposite. You can buy my secret for only [gwydd_gold] gold."
    g "名字常常会骗人，我其实没那么贪心，甚至恰恰相反。你只需[gwydd_gold]枚金币，就能买到我的秘密。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_6c379a84:

    # g "One Time Offer."
    g "一次性优惠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_dbcf2df5:

    # e "That's daylight robbery. I can just ask others about you..."
    e "那简直是明抢。我大可以去问别人关于你的事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_7c5bbed2:

    # g "Well. Who knows me better, a random stranger, those dimwits making out with each other up top, or me?"
    g "嗯。一个随便的陌生人、那些在上面互相亲热的蠢货，还是我自己——谁更了解我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_397a8a70:

    # g "You can always keep your money, and I can always keep my secret."
    g "你当然可以留着你的钱，我也当然可以保守我的秘密。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_9346b09a:

    # e "I suppose that's affordable."
    e "我想这价格还算付得起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_610d11af:

    # g "That's a bargain considering how broke you are for an adventurer."
    g "考虑到你这个冒险者穷成这样，这可是笔划算的买卖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_faffaa35:

    # e "Ehhphmmm..." nointeract
    e "呃嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_fcfacd9c:

    # e "Alright, [gwydd_gold] it is."
    e "好吧，就付[gwydd_gold]枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_f9dd0aa4:

    # "You hand the exact amount of gold to the complacent sheep."
    "你把分毫不差的金币交给那只自鸣得意的绵羊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_f740403d:

    # g "Good. Would be a bummer for you to miss out on the deal of the century."
    g "很好。要是错过这桩千载难逢的买卖，对你来说可就太遗憾了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_21fc6ed1:

    # e "It's still extremely overpriced for a story."
    e "可对一段故事来说，这价格还是贵得离谱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_5f6f2264:

    # g "I know."
    g "我知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_17eae391:

    # g "Anyway, The Ardent Cauldron. I got here for quite a long time actually."
    g "总之，这里就是炽热坩埚。我其实已经在这儿待了挺长时间了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_3fa5891e:

    # e "I can't afford that, Gwyddyon."
    e "我买不起那个，格威迪恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_eca8e4cf:

    # g "Unfortunate."
    g "真遗憾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_15e91cd0:

    # "The shopkeeper glances back at the crystal, and returns to his usual pose."
    "店主回头瞥了一眼水晶，随后恢复了平时的姿势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_2d615316:

    # g "The Ardent Cauldron... I got here for quite a long time actually."
    g "炽热坩埚……我其实已经在这儿待了挺长时间了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_2a63aab2:

    # g "Can't help, wanderer. You declined the offer the last time we talked."
    g "爱莫能助，漫游者。我们上次谈的时候，你拒绝了这个报价。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_06a6b3df:

    # e "What if I have the money... now?"
    e "可如果我……现在有钱了呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_Cauldron_History_19957a53:

    # g "Still a no. take a look at my other gadgets instead."
    g "还是不行。看看我其他的小玩意儿吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_a0e0fb24:

    # g "It was right after the previous shopkeeper was gone."
    g "就在之前那位店主离世后不久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_38b65da5:

    # e "Gone?"
    e "离世？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_d847b7d0:

    # g "Died of Old age. Condolences."
    g "寿终正寝。节哀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_b13b1b29:

    # "Gwyddyon puts his hands together to pray for a second, before immediately returning to his usual boast."
    "格威迪恩双手合十祈祷了一秒，随即又恢复了惯常的自夸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_3e8b7798:

    # g "I was studying jewelry in the capital when her son planned to sell the place."
    g "当时我正在首都学习珠宝技艺，她的儿子正打算把这里卖掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_abfa19c2:

    # g "See, what can be a better duo than me and a magic shop."
    g "你看，还有什么能比我和一家魔法商店更般配？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_9e4a105e:

    # e "Uhm... anything?"
    e "呃……比如任何别的组合？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_853dbd24:

    # "The sheep scoffs at your comment."
    "绵羊对你的话嗤之以鼻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_c3cbf5ef:

    # g "Anyhow, I bought the place at the highest price. Who knows all you need to beat a goat is with a bag of gold, and the shop is sold!"
    g "不管怎么说，我可是出了最高价买下这里的。谁能想到，要胜过一只山羊，只需要一袋金币，店就这么卖出去了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_5ca5c4c4:

    # g "After I took over, the sale was better than ever. That old dragon Haskell's potion were good. But I had something much more useful."
    g "我接手之后，生意比以往任何时候都好。那头老龙哈斯克尔的药水确实不错，可我手里还有更有用的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_678555ed:

    # e "Mmhmm... Crystal?"
    e "嗯……水晶？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_391013f0:

    # g "That's right. Crystal. You know what they are capable of."
    g "没错，水晶。你知道它们能做到什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_c3e81102:

    # g "Tevfik, Chieftain at the time, helped with the research. We basically reinvented different ways to harvest magical energy from crystal."
    g "当时还是酋长的特夫菲克也参与了研究。我们基本上重新发明了从水晶中汲取魔法能量的各种方法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_00f026b4:

    # g "Well, we planned to do the same for the primordial runes. Perhaps offer a movable magical source that's also unlimited."
    g "嗯，我们本来打算对原初符文也这么做。或许能提供一种可移动且取之不尽的魔法能源。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_048fc998:

    # g "It could have been the most glorious discovery of a lifetime."
    g "那本可以成为一生中最辉煌的发现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_f23deecb:

    # g "And it was until the primordial runes was stolen, that everything took a turn for the worse."
    g "直到原初符文被盗，一切才开始急转直下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_241ea238:

    # g "We lost that cheeky old bastard. Condolences."
    g "我们失去了那个淘气的老混蛋。节哀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_8a0cdd0f:

    # "Gwyddyon repeats the action of putting his hands together, but quickly put them away before he prays."
    "格威迪恩重复着合拢双手的动作，却在祈祷前迅速把手放了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_bc9b87e3:

    # e "I'm sorry about what happened, Gwyddyon."
    e "格威迪恩，我很遗憾会发生这种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_e66d70de:

    # g "After that, his son took over the tribe. The research was put to a pause."
    g "在那之后，他的儿子接管了部落，研究也只好暂时搁置。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_3a679f9f:

    # g "Furkan, that dimwit tried to shift our tribe away from using magic. So thereafter, my shop hasn't been making the best money."
    g "弗坎那个笨蛋试图让部落不再使用魔法。从那以后，我的店生意就一直不太景气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_4188ca70:

    # "You wish to console the sheep, but before you can do so he begins to speak once more."
    "你本想安慰这只羊，可还没来得及开口，他就又说了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_a2c5c302:

    # g "That's the history of the shop in my hand. I don't know much about what happened to the previous owner."
    g "这就是我手上这家店的来历。至于上一任主人后来怎么样，我就不太清楚了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_18f7f548:

    # g "But her son was wise enough to let someone competent to take over, not a common occurence here apparently."
    g "不过，她的儿子还算明智，知道该让有能力的人接手——看来这在这里可不常见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_4b340443:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_0613a7d9:

    # "Gwyddyon pauses for a second, looking back at you with a slight repulsion."
    "格威迪恩停顿了片刻，回头看向你，眼中带着些许厌恶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_f6268f49:

    # g "Anything else you want to know...?" nointeract
    g "还有什么想知道的吗……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_a98d41fd:

    # e "How did you meet Tevfik?"
    e "你是怎么认识特夫菲克的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_89f45d62:

    # g "When I bought the shop, obviously. But we only formally met after opening the shop."
    g "当然是在我买下这家店的时候。不过，直到店铺开张后，我们才算正式认识。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_893c4b3b:

    # g "He came to visit us during the soldiers' routine training. They bought almost everything from the shop, apart from the crystals."
    g "士兵们例行训练时，他来拜访我们。他们几乎买走了店里所有东西，只有水晶除外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_e69dd950:

    # g "And I sold the first crystal to Tevfik."
    g "我还把第一块水晶卖给了特夫菲克。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_c11b6019:

    # e "Did he know what it does?"
    e "他知道那东西有什么用吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_9db59a41:

    # g "He didn't. But he was fairly interested in these little precious novelty."
    g "他不知道。不过，他对这些小巧珍贵的新奇玩意儿相当感兴趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_77e9865e:

    # g "The old ram invited me to his quarter soon after, we talked about magic the whole day, I didn't leave until the next morning."
    g "没过多久，那只老公羊就邀请我去了他的住处。我们聊了一整天的魔法，我直到第二天早上才离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_b061e187:

    # g "He was, quite a ram. But he had one weakness."
    g "他确实是只不折不扣的公羊。不过，他有一个弱点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_d3704335:

    # e "What was it...?"
    e "是什么……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_327e3219:

    # g "He cared for his son too much."
    g "他太过疼爱自己的儿子了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_3388a208:

    # e "Oh..."
    e "哦……"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_9527f928:

    # e "What were you doing before buying this place?"
    e "你买下这里之前，都在做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_a8fc9aa4:

    # g "Did I forget to tell you? Anyhow, I was studying Jewelry Trading in the Capital."
    g "我是不是忘了告诉你？总之，我当时在首都学习珠宝贸易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_e7e5ea7c:

    # g "It was a breeze living in the capital. You've got everything you need as long as you're born rich."
    g "住在首都可轻松了。只要你生来有钱，想要的一切应有尽有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_7b4cbdd6:

    # g "And I was, but I wasn't fond of the king over there."
    g "我确实生来富有，但我不喜欢那里的国王。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_a980eef6:

    # g "Gold had never been an issue for me. So I just bought the shop when I saw their poster flying in the street."
    g "金钱对我从来不是问题。所以我在街头看到他们张贴的海报后，就直接把那家店买了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_b0eb0807:

    # e "Oh... That's it?"
    e "哦……就这样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_e3a34452:

    # g "I didn't exactly care for the shop, until Tevfik came and saw the crystal I had for sale."
    g "我本来对开店没什么兴趣，直到特夫菲克来了，看到我拿来出售的水晶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_bcd391ad:

    # g "Honestly, I didn't expect them to be sold, it was just my personal research."
    g "说实话，我没指望它们能卖出去，那只是我的个人研究。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_8576db28:

    # g "But after that day, customers keep coming right at my doorstep. Tevfik must have shared the news of my work."
    g "可从那天起，客人就不断找上门来。特夫菲克一定把我的研究传出去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_35cc0012:

    # g "Living here was better than my life back then."
    g "住在这里比我那时的生活好多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_e94126bc:

    # "Gwyddyon give you a slight glance."
    "格威迪恩瞥了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_977359b8:

    # g "Well, honestly, we have to call it a day here. I'd like to keep my remaining secret safe and sound."
    g "好了，说实话，我们今天就到此为止吧。我想把剩下的秘密好好保守住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_ef8b4b93:

    # g "And so should you."
    g "你也应该如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_ab40fdc9:

    # e "W-wait, I've paid for this..."
    e "等、等等，我可是付过钱的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_a8ad23d6:

    # g "You've paid for a lot of my history already. A shopkeeper has to tend his shop, not to tell you bed-time stories."
    g "你已经为听我的许多经历付了不少钱。店主该打理自己的店铺，而不是给你讲睡前故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_a3e17b37:

    # g "However, feel free to check out what I have here, spend as much as you want."
    g "不过，你尽管看看我这儿有什么，想花多少就花多少。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_1a73ab4b:

    # "The shopkeeper returns to stare at his crystal, ignoring your silent protest and pleading."
    "店主又转回去盯着他的水晶，完全不理会你无声的抗议和恳求。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Ask_History_Cauldron_48916b18:

    # "Disheartened, you leave the sheep alone."
    "你心灰意冷，只好不再理会那只羊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_59ca023c:

    # e "What's up with the rocks."
    e "这些石头是怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_59066480:

    # g "They're minerals! Wanderer."
    g "那是矿物！流浪者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_5684891d:

    # g "I know you've been living with that dimwit of a lion, but please do not mistake my life-long invention just as another rock."
    g "我知道你一直和那头蠢狮子住在一起，但请别把我毕生的发明也当成普通石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_d71a69f9:

    # e "Oh... Is that why Seb has a weird rock collection in his shop?"
    e "哦……所以塞布店里才会有一堆奇怪的石头收藏？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_1e6bd3c6:

    # g "Those are rocks, I taught him when he first started with the shop with his lizard friend."
    g "那是岩石。刚和他的蜥蜴朋友一起开店时，我教过他这些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_d5539639:

    # g "But instead of getting fascinated by the amazing properties of magical crystals like a normal person would, he went to look at normal rocks!"
    g "可他没有像正常人那样被魔法水晶的奇妙特性迷住，反而跑去研究普通岩石！"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_dac7d11f:

    # g "Like this one."
    g "就像这一块。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_bd5ee5c8:

    # "Gwyddyon takes out a crumbly rock from his counter, it's coarse with patches of moss on top."
    "格威迪恩从柜台上拿出一块易碎的岩石，表面粗糙，还长着一片片苔藓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_d05a96aa:

    # "You stare at it for a while, it looks just like what Sebas has in his rock collection."
    "你盯着它看了一会儿，发现它和塞巴斯收藏的石头简直一模一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_77689845:

    # e "Is this one magical?"
    e "这块是有魔力的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_2d1b86a7:

    # g "NO! It's a normal rock I picked up from the road!"
    g "不！这是我从路边捡来的普通石头！"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_a113fe33:

    # e "A-ah... alright. Seb would happily take it home and frame this thing along with the other rocks."
    e "啊、啊……好吧。塞巴斯肯定会乐意把这东西带回家，和其他石头一起装框。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_92aae5ef:

    # g "Yes, and don't get me started with his unwillingness of learning basic rock classifying."
    g "对，而且别让我开始数落他连基本的岩石分类都不愿意学。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_69582d41:

    # e "But I think he knows what he's doing, if not for his study on the guardian's hand, I wouldn't have known about your Chief's situation."
    e "不过我觉得他知道自己在做什么。要不是他研究了守护者之手，我也不会知道你们酋长的情况。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_8fdd04e3:

    # g "You're talking like I cared about the chief."
    g "你说得好像我在乎那个酋长似的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_5aceab4a:

    # "He pauses suddenly, staring at you with a raised brow."
    "他突然停了下来，挑起眉毛盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_cf84932b:

    # g "How are you still here anyway, shouldn't you be gone looking for your friend?"
    g "你怎么还在这儿？你不是应该已经去找你的朋友了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_f7dd8c38:

    # e "Maybe if you give me the clues as to where he went... that'd be much appreciated."
    e "要是你能给我一些他去了哪里的线索……那就再好不过了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_d8821b10:

    # g "Ambitious, aren't you?"
    g "野心不小啊，是吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_f057211a:

    # g "Look, there's something I needed, getting me enough of them could grant you a privilege of talking to me."
    g "听着，我需要一些东西。你给我弄来足够多的那些东西，我就可以破例让你和我说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_9075a4cb:

    # e "Is that a fair trade?"
    e "这算公平交易吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_0a8fedf5:

    # g "Depends on whether you're hardworking and all."
    g "那得看你是不是肯卖力干活之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_15257dd5:

    # g "You've been in the mines?"
    g "你去过矿井？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_052b6518:

    # e "Uh? What mines?"
    e "啊？什么矿井？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_6baff862:

    # g "Any mines at all, presumably from the werewolves."
    g "任何矿井都行，大概是狼人那边的矿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_dff85f8d:

    # e "I did, how did you know?"
    e "我去过，你怎么知道的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_9d55979d:

    # g "You're shining of crystals. Those who are dimwits can't see the light, but I can."
    g "你身上闪耀着水晶的光芒。那些蠢货看不见这光，但我看得见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_7f4e3b05:

    # "Gwyddyon taps his finger on the monocles. Perhaps the glass has something reflective in it?"
    "格威迪恩用手指敲了敲单片眼镜。也许玻璃里有什么东西能反光？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_3a3dddce:

    # e "Am I a dimwit?"
    e "我是笨蛋吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_c6ee028c:

    # g "Yes, a different kind of dimwit, I must say."
    g "是的，不过是另一种笨蛋，我得说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_c7dd6d15:

    # g "I don't require much effort, just give me a few of the minerals you've seen in the cave."
    g "我不需要你费多大劲，只要把你在洞穴里见过的几种矿物给我就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_21b8f708:

    # g "I used to get them all the time when the brown one was alive, but every day in the dark forest is a dangerous one."
    g "棕色的那个还活着时，我以前总能弄到它们，但黑暗森林里的每一天都很危险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_7b843e99:

    # g "Now they're killing each other again."
    g "他们又在自相残杀了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_26307c75:

    # e "Uhm... What do you need?"
    e "呃……你需要什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_1810ae7e:

    # g "Like the last time, I'll need 10 pieces of [mineralofchoicy]."
    g "和上次一样，我需要10块[mineralofchoicy]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_2fc56c6e:

    # g "Have you seen Lodestones?"
    g "你见过磁石吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_5b0dabfc:

    # g "Those are magical rocks that is embedded in nature."
    g "那是嵌在大自然中的魔法岩石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_448dd460:

    # e "Why are they magical?"
    e "为什么说它们是魔法的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_0031cde5:

    # g "These rocks don't have magic. But they attract metal rocks, earlier folks used them for navigation dangerous forest."
    g "这些岩石没有魔法，但能吸引金属矿石。以前的人们用它们在危险的森林里辨路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_2609e333:

    # e "They're magnetic, aren't they?"
    e "它们是有磁性的，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_ff35ab19:

    # g "Correct, that's why they come in handy for some ingenious devices I'm making."
    g "没错，所以它们正好能派上用场，制作一些我正在打造的精巧装置。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_74b61c2f:

    # g "I don't need much, just 10 pieces of Lodestones would deem enough."
    g "我不需要多少，10块磁石就够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_d5a63896:

    # e "Oh... ok."
    e "哦……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_49ac0d09:

    # g "You know about copper, right?"
    g "你知道铜，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_ca113fb5:

    # g "Nothing fancy, just give me 10 of them."
    g "没什么特别的，给我10块就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_ee5b99ff:

    # g "After you finished, I'll give you what you deserve, 100 gold."
    g "完成后，我会给你应得的报酬——100枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_0838ee03:

    # e "That sounds fair."
    e "听起来很公平。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_5fdc4c06:

    # "You say sarcastically, with a raised voice."
    "你提高声音，讽刺地说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_9a0fbfc7:

    # g "Fair? That's probably the greatest trade deal of the century, if not all time."
    g "公平？这大概是本世纪、甚至有史以来最划算的交易了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_fd56a20b:

    # "You were not sure if he's not too bright to notice the sarcasm, or he's willfully ignoring the glaring difference in rewards."
    "你不确定，他究竟是迟钝到察觉不出你的讽刺，还是故意无视报酬之间那悬殊的差距。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_3d6829c5:

    # g "And on top of that, if you've done enough, I can sell you some information about what I know."
    g "而且，如果你做得够多，我还可以把我所知的一些情报卖给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_987e3d37:

    # e "Really?"
    e "真的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_e01c9819:

    # g "Real. For maybe 450 gold."
    g "真的。大概450枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_a319ec39:

    # e "But wait, doesn't that mean, I have to give you 350 gold, AND give you the [mineralofchoicy]?"
    e "但等等，这不是说我得给你350枚金币，还得把[mineralofchoicy]也给你吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_7a025b9a:

    # "That was far too steep of a price, and you know Gwyddyon knows it too."
    "那个价格实在高得离谱，而且你知道格威迪恩自己也清楚这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_42bd778a:

    # g "It's what it costs."
    g "这就是它的价钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_c138f530:

    # e "Damn, Gwyd. You're more of a ruthless businessman than Cane."
    e "见鬼，格威德。你比凯恩还像个冷酷无情的商人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_bb29a33f:

    # g "Maybe we're both eying that bulge in your pant for a long time."
    g "也许我们都盯着你裤子里的凸起看了很久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_b995fac7:

    # "Was he flirting at you? He doesn't look like the type but admittedly you feel your crotch getting hard just from Gwyddyon staring at it."
    "他是在跟你调情吗？他看起来不像是那种人，不过说实话，光是格威迪恩盯着你的胯部看，就让你感觉那里硬了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_c18eb48e:

    # e "W-what?"
    e "什——什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_9b1ddf7f:

    # g "It's the gold in your pouch. As an ardent researcher it's normal to require a substantial sum of capital investment."
    g "是你钱袋里的金币。作为一名热心的研究者，需要一笔可观的资金投入也很正常。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_623afffd:

    # g "And I've not had access to anywhere up there because of those dimwits, so it makes sense why I'm squeezing every little gold out of you."
    g "而且都怪那些蠢货，我一直没法去上面任何地方，所以我当然得想办法从你身上榨出每一枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_c780c32a:

    # g "I used to be an exception, under his father's order. But now, no one is allowed anywhere near the site."
    g "我以前奉他父亲之命，是个例外。但现在，任何人都不许靠近那个地点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_0ea53e24:

    # g "It turns out that apple does fall far from the tree."
    g "看来这孩子还真不像他父亲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_b6054fb3:

    # "Gwyddyon scractches at his monocle."
    "格威迪恩抚了抚他的单片眼镜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_5309ab5e:

    # e "I think Furkan is just a different leader than who Tevfik was."
    e "我觉得弗坎只是和泰夫菲克不同的领袖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_3a7bde85:

    # "He raises his brow again, this time paired with a concerned look."
    "他再次挑起眉毛，这次脸上带着担忧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_00633d11:

    # g "Do you trust him?" nointeract
    g "你信任他吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_b81c4a06:

    # e "I do. He's loyal and capable."
    e "我信。他既忠诚又能干。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_1be72bee:

    # g "It's going to cost you a lot trusting someone who you know nothing about..."
    g "信任一个你一无所知的人，可是要付出不小代价的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_fb3b7603:

    # "You still believe Furkan deserves some merits, regardless of what the goat tribe has been lately."
    "不管山羊部落最近变成什么样，你还是相信弗坎值得肯定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_f8b23318:

    # e "He is a good friend, but sometimes his decisions are... questionable."
    e "他是个好朋友，但有时候他的决定……很值得怀疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_f7842e87:

    # g "Well, see? I know we'd have more in common than a clueless ram who's out of his depth."
    g "你看，我就知道咱们比起那只不自量力的糊涂公羊，更有共同语言。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_7c194227:

    # "You remain silent, even you've advocated for Furkan, you can't stop but see the deep troubles goat tribe has gotten into."
    "你沉默不语。即便你为弗坎说了好话，也无法视而不见山羊部落陷入的重重困境。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_041c427f:

    # g "Now I know a little more about you, with the price of nothing."
    g "现在我又多了解了你一点，而且分文未花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_6d4d3f5b:

    # e "Still the same reward?"
    e "奖励还是一样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_5c4acffe:

    # g "Yes, 100 gold, and an additional opportunity to talk about anything else you need."
    g "没错，100枚金币，另外还可以再找我谈谈其他你需要的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_e335fe1f:

    # e "You're really talking like it's worth the price."
    e "听你说得好像这价格还挺值。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_20bb1e92:

    # "Gwyddyon shows you a faint smile, before he sends you away."
    "格威迪恩朝你露出一丝淡淡的微笑，随后打发你离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_a1f619b4:

    # g "Go now, Wanderer. Don't come back until you've gotten what I needed."
    g "去吧，漫游者。拿到我需要的东西之前，别回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_Inquire_47680ae6:

    # e "Hey, Gwyd. What do I need again?"
    e "嘿，格威德？我又需要什么来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_Inquire_881cb3c1:

    # g "Lodestone, inside the cavern in the dark forest."
    g "磁石，在黑暗森林的洞穴里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_Inquire_4a064de2:

    # g "Copper, inside the cavern in the dark forest."
    g "铜，在黑暗森林的洞窟里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_Inquire_9c5fa07c:

    # g "I need 10 of them so you better hurry up."
    g "我需要10个，所以你最好快点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_Inquire_7634acec:

    # e "O-ok..."
    e "好、好的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_End_8e60628c:

    # e "Gwyd, I've returned with the [mineralofchoicy]."
    e "格威德，我带着[mineralofchoicy]回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_End_0f067bda:

    # g "Is the number right?"
    g "数量对吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_End_30a37427:

    # e "You put forth all of the [mineralofchoicy], and push in front of him."
    e "你拿出所有[mineralofchoicy]，推到他面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_End_a62003d1:

    # e "Yes, all 10, on the counter, right now."
    e "对，整整10个，现在都在柜台上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_End_ceaa463e:

    # g "Hmm. That one's a little funky, but I'll accept your effort."
    g "嗯，那批东西有点古怪，不过我会接受你的努力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Mining_Task_End_d512bb51:

    # g "Here's your reward. all 100 gold, fair price, isn't it?"
