translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_edcb25a5:

    # g "W-welcome to the Ardent Cauldron, we're almost closed-"
    g "欢、欢迎来到炽热坩埚，我们快打烊了——"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_309bf759:

    # "You hear the usual accosting, only this time it's in a raspy voice."
    "你听到了惯常的招呼，只是这次声音沙哑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_9178ee15:

    # "The magic shopkeeper looks up, and he is greeted by your dumbfounded face."
