translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_d4b54357:

    # g "Wanderer, you're just in time, look at this thing."
    g "流浪者，你来得正是时候，看看这个东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_5aa671f5:

    # e "H-hey Gwyd, what's that?"
    e "嘿、嘿，格威德，那是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_2f3c68ce:

    # g "A crystal I found in my stash. It was from near the primordial runes."
    g "我从库存里找到的一块水晶。它来自原初符文附近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_c8e29bf1:

    # g "I collected the crystal back before it was gone, I never got to learn of its true power."
    g "我在它消失前就把水晶收集起来了，却一直没能得知它真正的力量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_e792ce59:

    # g "I just happened to remember it when you just arrived to my shop."
    g "你刚到我店里的时候，我才碰巧想起了它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_673088e5:

    # g "But I gotta say, the dust on that thing is going to give me hack of a cough no magic is going to cure."
    g "不过得说，那东西上的灰尘会让我咳个不停，任何魔法都治不好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_781b834b:

    # "Gwyddyon points to his throat, you can still hear the croaky breathing as he speaks."
    "格威迪恩指了指自己的喉咙；他说话时，你仍能听见他沙哑的呼吸声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_e752f764:

    # e "Uh... I hope you recover soon?"
    e "呃……希望你早日康复？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_5b976537:

    # g "Yeah. We're talking crystal here, don't distract yourself from my sore throat."
    g "对。现在说的是水晶，别把话题从我这嗓子疼上扯开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_5f7743c9:

    # g "Nothing is going to fit inside this for a while- I mean food, eating."
    g "这东西暂时什么都塞不进去——我是说食物，吃东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_41e9c065:

    # "You give him a concerned glance, only to for him to ignore you entirely and stare back at the crystal."
    "你担忧地瞥了他一眼，他却完全不理会你，只顾回头盯着水晶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_6f071556:

    # g "C-crystal. Don't you ever fiddle with this one, my friend. It can only be handled with a professional hand."
    g "水、水晶。朋友，你可千万别摆弄这块。只有专业人士才能经手它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_74fc1d88:

    # g "Especially when there's not many evidence or research ever done on the subject matter."
    g "尤其是关于这东西，过去几乎没有多少证据或研究。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_673f7554:

    # g "We shall be extra careful, regardless of how many times you helped me deliver the minerals, or the discount I spared you."
    g "无论你帮我运送过多少次矿物，也不管我给你留过多少优惠，我们都得格外小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_ee6fb589:

    # e "What discount?"
    e "什么优惠？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Research_Quest_89b7a043:

    # g "That's the spirit, you need to forget they have ever existed."
    g "这就对了，你得忘了它们曾经存在过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_76a014e4:

    # e "Gwyd? Would you mind if I ask some questions?"
    e "格威德？我问几个问题，你不会介意吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_71f3cbce:

    # g "Would you mind if I say no? I'm onto something much more important here."
    g "你介意我说不吗？我正忙着弄一件重要得多的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_71ea3ed6:

    # e "Uh... yes."
    e "呃……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_67b46cf1:

    # g "Hmmph, well wanderer. Since I care too much about a courier's opinion of me, as you may have believed. You may ask away."
    g "哼，行吧，流浪者。就好像我真的很在意一个信使怎么看我——你大概是这么以为的。尽管问吧。"

