    # e "Uh..." nointeract
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_419db852:

    # e "So! Where did you find these crystals?"
    e "那么！你是在哪里找到这些水晶的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_30890771:

    # "You point at the one Gwyddyon is holding."
    "你指了指格威迪恩手里拿着的那块。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_99bc04e3:

    # g "Why... why do you need to know?"
    g "为、为什么……你想知道这个干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_44c9ee7f:

    # e "Uh- I was just making up conversations, Gwyd. And it's never you who start one."
    e "呃——我只是随口找话题而已，格威德。可从来都不是你先开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_e5475fbd:

    # g "Maybe because I'm not as interested in you than you'd think. Also, that's a fairly weird thing to ask, [e]."
    g "也许是因为我没你以为的那么对你感兴趣。再说了，这问题问得相当怪，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_83991324:

    # g "Are you trying to open another shop?"
    g "你是想再开一家店吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_2da20167:

    # e "No! Of course no."
    e "不！当然不是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_839b8078:

    # "Gwyddyon squints his eyes, his brows still remain furrowed as he resumes his inspections on the crystals."
    "格威迪恩眯起眼睛，眉头依旧紧锁，又继续检查那些水晶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_c38faa6d:

    # e "Lovely weather today, isn't it?"
    e "今天天气真好，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_e6350b89:

    # "Gwyddyon continues ignoring you, doesn't even sparing another glance."
    "格威迪恩继续无视你，甚至连头都没再回一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_f48a8199:

    # e "Gwyd!"
    e "格威德！"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_c2cffbd7:

    # g "Do I have to engage in meaningless small talks with you right now?"
    g "你现在非得跟我进行这些毫无意义的闲聊吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_a085433e:

    # e "You said I can ask any questions."
    e "你说过我什么问题都能问。"

