    # g "Well, it doesn't mean ALL questions, you dimwit."
    g "呃，我说的可不是所有问题，你这个蠢货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_02b63c89:

    # e "So, what are those rocks in that display?"
    e "那么，展示柜里的那些石头是什么？"

