    # g "Uh, they're just decorative rocks, nothing magical about those."
    g "呃，那些只是装饰石，没什么魔法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_f4e82a49:

    # e "But these look kinda pretty, no?"
    e "不过这些看起来还挺漂亮的，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_211ae7e4:

    # g "Yeah, I told that lion from the other shop to collect them for me so he can finally leave me alone."
    g "对，我让隔壁店里的那头狮子帮我收集，好让他终于别再烦我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_f843df74:

    # g "Little did I know, he spent days and weeks trying to collect useless rocks, soon he started giving me different shapes of rocks as some weird gifts."
    g "我哪知道，他花了好几天、好几个星期去收集那些没用的石头，没过多久还开始把不同形状的石头当作某种怪礼物送给我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_4daada5b:

    # g "And I considered that... a toll on my mental capacity."
    g "而我觉得那是……对我精神承受力的折磨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_a600bf19:

    # e "Cock or Butt?"
    e "鸡巴还是屁股？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_08a79ca8:

    # g "What?"
    g "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_51582d08:

    # e "well, which side are you on?"
    e "呃，你站哪边？"

