    # "Gwyddyon furrows his brows and stares at you with a weird look."
    "格威迪恩皱起眉头，用一种古怪的目光盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_7e0b0aa2:

    # g "I'm not answering that."
    g "这我不回答。"

