    # e "So, how many customers are interested in these crystals?"
    e "那么，有多少顾客对这些水晶感兴趣？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_24a6f3ec:

    # g "Uh, are you Furkan? Because you ask the same nonsense as that dimwit of a leader does."
    g "呃，你是弗坎吗？因为你问的问题，跟那个蠢货首领问的一样荒唐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_dedc59b1:

    # e "Well, I suppose the number is low."
    e "嗯，我想这个数字不大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_63a82c81:

    # g "Wanderer, there's a limit to my patience here. If you're not here for my goods, the door's right there and you're welcomed to pass through, one way trip."
    g "漫游者，我的耐心是有限的。你要不是来买我的货，那边就是门，欢迎你从那里出去——这是一趟单程旅程。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_ef5775d5:

    # "Just as Gwyddyon turn around for another procedures to his job, you shout to get his attention quickly."
    "格威迪恩正转身去继续处理工作时，你连忙喊住他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_1281e655:

    # e "Wait..." nointeract
    e "等等……"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_0a37c41b:

    # e "So, I see there were some gemstones and crystals you have there on the shelves. Did you make them all by yourself?"
    e "所以，我看到你架子上摆着一些宝石和水晶。都是你自己做的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_b30d3fd6:

    # g "Yes, I did. Where else do you think they come from?"
    g "是我做的。不然你以为它们是从哪儿来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_d7a53af8:

    # e "I don't know, I thought you were working on a magic shop, not a mineral reserve."
    e "我不知道，我还以为你是在经营魔法商店，而不是什么矿物储备库。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_7739556f:

    # g "Huh, well. Maybe you're right, those are from someone else who lives far away from here, admittedly a little more fastidious than Haskell, or, a little more."
    g "呃，好吧。你说得也许没错，那些东西可能来自某个住在很远地方的人——不得不说，那人比哈斯克尔讲究一点，或者说，更……一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_1e032577:

    # g "But, there's one thing about him that's been generally troublesome."
    g "不过，他身上有一件事一直挺让人头疼的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_79bc9ac6:

    # e "What's it?"
    e "是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_f47dff3f:

    # g "Ugh, don't ask. I'm working on it."
    g "呃，别问。我正在想办法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_fd417f00:

    # g "Still, a crystal is useless unless you understand how to harness its power. I've raised his stones' value almost nine-fold selling them here. How can he not appreciate my work."
    g "不过，除非你懂得如何驾驭水晶的力量，否则水晶就是没用的东西。我把他的石头拿到这里来卖，已经让它们的价值提高了将近九倍。他怎么可能不认可我的成果？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_317e4fc9:

    # e "How did you get your reputation as the shopkeeper of the goats?"
    e "你是怎么赢得山羊族商店老板这个名声的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_11d3f9b5:

    # g "Don't know much about reputation, but this? This place is the heart of the tribe. A central hub for every goats to trade and talk."
    g "我不太懂什么名声，但这里？这里可是部族的核心，是所有山羊进行交易和交谈的中心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_63103a35:

    # g "How would you associate goats? The magic. And what do you think of when someone talks about magic?" nointeract
    g "你会把山羊和什么联系起来？魔法。那别人谈到魔法时，你会想到什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_410d0d5d:

    # e "Well, the goats?"
    e "呃，山羊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_ca953b79:

    # g "No! You dimwit of a dimwit. That doesn't even make any sense, are you going to think about magic next? How creative."
    g "不！你这个蠢货中的蠢货。这根本说不通。接下来你是不是还要想到魔法？真有创意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_4b8d189e:

    # e "Uh, I thought it was a question...?"
    e "呃，我还以为那是个问题……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_a4d78a6f:

    # g "Yeah, perhaps I expected too much of you. The answer is right here, the Ardent Cauldron."
    g "是啊，也许是我对你的期待太高了。答案就在这里——炽热坩埚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_d5a0260e:

    # e "Ah! Ardent Cauldron, of course!"
    e "啊！当然是炽热坩埚！"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_c5eecfef:

    # g "Needless to say, you are undeniably correct."
    g "不用说，你当然是无可争议地正确。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_209707be:

    # e "Uh..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_c58ddeaf:

    # g "Uh what?"
    g "呃，什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_03ef5385:

    # "You stumbles on just a little silence, before Gwyddyon pouts."
    "你只是短暂地陷入了沉默，随后格威迪恩撅起了嘴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_a4d78a6f_1:

    # g "Yeah, perhaps I expected too much of you. The answer is right here, the Ardent Cauldron."
    g "是啊，也许是我对你的期待太高了。答案就在这里——炽热坩埚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_1131b813:

    # g "I've spent dozens of years, building up this shop step by step. Moreso invested my whole life's saving into promoting our crystals."
    g "我花了几十年，一步一步把这家店经营起来。更不用说，我还把毕生积蓄都投入到了推广我们的水晶上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_46bbf171:

    # g "To be recognised by everyone, of course the placement of the shop is important. But more importantly we sell only carefully selected items right here. No more subpar potions or common rocks you pick up by the road."
    g "要让所有人都认识我们，商店的位置当然很重要。但更重要的是，我们只在这里售卖精心挑选的商品。不会再有劣质药剂，也不会再有你在路边随手捡到的普通石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_cf829725:

    # g "We are here to sell something magical. Something that makes you feel luxurious, and of course, the price is one of the experience."
    g "我们来这里，就是要售卖某种神奇的东西。某种能让你感到奢华的东西。当然，价格也是体验的一部分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_e24efa1c:

    # e "Wait, you mean you set the price this high, just because people liked... expensive things?"
    e "等等，你的意思是，你把价格定得这么高，只是因为人们喜欢……昂贵的东西？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_7375aed9:

    # g "It'd be a lapse in judgement to say our everyday customers can discern between high grade crystals and the lower ones, wouldn't you say? We need a high profit margin here to maintain a sustainable line-up of our daily magical necessities."
    g "要是说我们那些日常顾客能分辨出高品质水晶和低品质水晶，那可就太不明智了，不是吗？我们需要足够高的利润率，才能维持日常魔法必需品的稳定供应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_6f274d54:

    # g "Besides, doesn't a cheap item, makes you feel cheap? Doesn't it feel too effortless?"
    g "再说了，廉价的东西不会让你也觉得自己很廉价吗？难道不会觉得太轻松就能得到了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_f3ce4098:

    # e "I- but these are people's necessities, right?"
    e "我——可这些都是人们的必需品，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_0c098ccd:

    # g "Don't you worry, wanderer. They can absolutely pay for that. Our customers are wealthy bunch who'd pay to maintain their flamboyant magical lifestyle. The only concern is our chief unfortunately had taken that away, along with many other things."
    g "别担心，旅行者。他们绝对付得起。我们的客人都是有钱人，愿意花钱维持他们浮华的魔法生活方式。唯一的问题是，我们的酋长不幸把这些连同许多其他东西一起夺走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_6415575a:

    # e "Alright, but I'm still baffled you said that so nonchalantly."
    e "好吧，可我还是很困惑，你居然能那么若无其事地说出这种话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Gwyddyon_Voting_Trade_11a28cd0:

    # e "So, Gwyddyon, why do you seem to hold a particular grudge against Furkan?"
    e "那么，格威迪恩，你为什么好像特别记恨弗坎？"

